  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Growing up in the ruins of 'Dia De Los Drinks,' a pre-collapse watering hole, 'Bland' Benny always had a nose for trouble. He learned to play the drums on empty barrels, attracting unwanted attention from rival flocks which made him seek refuge with the 'Shadow Syndicate.' Now, he lays down the beat for their raids, a grim rhythm echoing through Subchain City.",
    "class": "Riot Medic",
    "name": "Bland 'Bite' Benny",
    "personality": "Grimly pragmatic, Benny's seen too much to crack a smile. Resourceful, he can turn scrap into something useful, especially when it comes to patching up his flock-mates. Secretly, he yearns for the days when the only blood he saw was spilled beer.",
